WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.864 --> 00:00:19.091
The squire's daughters, Jessie and Flora, liked to play with all the children in the neighborhood.

2
00:00:20.111 --> 00:00:23.093
The other children loved Merrylegs just as much as the girls did.

3
00:00:25.094 --> 00:00:30.056
The cheerful gray pony often spent hours giving them all rides in the orchard or up and down

4
00:00:30.076 --> 00:00:30.556
the drive.

5
00:00:33.988 --> 00:00:36.729
One afternoon he spent an especially long time with them.

6
00:00:37.889 --> 00:00:40.270
Finally James led Merrylegs back into the stable.

7
00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:48.752
"There you go, you little rascal," the groom said with a chuckle as he pulled off the pony's

8
00:00:48.792 --> 00:00:49.592
saddle and bridle.

9
00:00:50.612 --> 00:00:53.033
"You'd better behave yourself better next time.

10
00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:56.234
Otherwise we will both get in deep trouble."

11
00:00:58.054 --> 00:01:01.015
When the young man had left, I looked into the pony's stall.

12
00:01:01.035 --> 00:01:03.636
"What have you been doing, Merrylegs?"

13
00:01:04.072 --> 00:01:04.633
I asked him.

14
00:01:05.673 --> 00:01:07.454
Merrylegs tossed his pretty little head.

15
00:01:07.474 --> 00:01:10.557
"Nothing much," he said.

16
00:01:10.577 --> 00:01:14.819
"Just teaching some young humans a lesson, that's all."

17
00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:19.002
Ginger looked up from the rack where she stood eating hay.

18
00:01:20.303 --> 00:01:21.004
"What do you mean?"

19
00:01:21.504 --> 00:01:22.104
she asked.

20
00:01:23.305 --> 00:01:26.067
"They couldn't tell when I'd had enough," he said.

21
00:01:26.347 --> 00:01:27.928
So I tossed them off backward.

22
00:01:29.129 --> 00:01:31.631
That was the only way to make them understand."

23
00:01:31.651 --> 00:01:34.128
"What?" I cried.

24
00:01:34.148 --> 00:01:38.230
"Are you saying you threw off Miss Jessie or Miss Flora?"

25
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:41.391
"Of course not!"

26
00:01:41.792 --> 00:01:42.992
Merrylegs looked offended.

27
00:01:43.012 --> 00:01:45.493
"I would never do that.

28
00:01:46.854 --> 00:01:50.375
I take better care of those young ladies than their own parents do!

29
00:01:51.456 --> 00:01:57.698
And I'm always patient with the smaller children, no matter how much they squeal or bounce on my

30
00:01:57.758 --> 00:02:01.640
back. I'm the one who teaches them all to ride."

31
00:02:02.848 --> 00:02:05.569
"Yes, that's what everyone says," I said.

32
00:02:05.589 --> 00:02:11.451
"It was the older boys who needed the lesson this time," Merrylegs went on.

33
00:02:11.471 --> 00:02:17.912
"In case you don't know, boys need to be trained as much as we horses do when we're

34
00:02:17.972 --> 00:02:21.573
colts. They need to be taught what's right."

35
00:02:22.974 --> 00:02:24.314
"I see," I said.

36
00:02:24.334 --> 00:02:25.495
"But what happened?"

37
00:02:25.515 --> 00:02:28.215
"I'm trying to tell you!"

38
00:02:28.535 --> 00:02:30.016
Merrylegs tossed his head again.

39
00:02:31.224 --> 00:02:34.546
"The other children rode me for a couple of hours, as usual.

40
00:02:35.727 --> 00:02:38.748
Finally the older boys decided it was their turn.

41
00:02:38.768 --> 00:02:42.350
"At first I had no problem with that.

42
00:02:43.831 --> 00:02:49.594
I carried them around one at a time, galloping through the fields and orchard just as they wished.

43
00:02:53.156 --> 00:02:55.418
This went on for at least another hour."

44
00:02:55.438 --> 00:02:59.380
"You must have been tired by then," Ginger said.

45
00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:02.961
"A little," Merrylegs said.

46
00:03:02.981 --> 00:03:04.942
"But I know my job.

47
00:03:06.403 --> 00:03:10.545
And I was happy to do it, even though the boys had made a whip out of a

48
00:03:10.625 --> 00:03:11.866
large twig they found.

49
00:03:13.206 --> 00:03:17.069
They used it a bit too much, but I put up with it for a while.

50
00:03:18.129 --> 00:03:22.872
They ran me around and around as fast as I could go, whipping me all the way.

51
00:03:22.892 --> 00:03:27.014
"Finally, though, I decided I'd had enough.

52
00:03:28.174 --> 00:03:30.756
So I stopped a few times to give them the hint.

53
00:03:31.264 --> 00:03:33.886
But all they did was whip me even more!"

54
00:03:33.906 --> 00:03:35.708
"Oh dear!"

55
00:03:36.148 --> 00:03:36.528
I said.

56
00:03:36.548 --> 00:03:44.455
"Those silly boys never stopped to think that a pony can get tired, or have any feelings at

57
00:03:44.795 --> 00:03:46.196
all," Merrylegs said.

58
00:03:46.216 --> 00:03:49.799
"They treated me like an old bicycle.

59
00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:56.144
Finally I decided it was time to help them understand it was wrong.

60
00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:03.142
So I stood up on my hind legs just enough to tip my rider off over my hind

61
00:04:03.303 --> 00:04:04.783
end. That's all."

62
00:04:04.803 --> 00:04:07.184
"Did they understand then?"

63
00:04:07.624 --> 00:04:08.064
I asked.

64
00:04:08.084 --> 00:04:12.166
"Not at first," Merrylegs said calmly.

65
00:04:12.186 --> 00:04:16.768
"I had to tip each of the boys off a few more times.

66
00:04:18.149 --> 00:04:20.490
But finally they began to catch on.

67
00:04:23.151 --> 00:04:28.233
And when they brought me to James and complained, he was annoyed to see their homemade whip.

68
00:04:28.773 --> 00:04:31.855
He said they didn't need anything like that to ride me."

69
00:04:33.916 --> 00:04:34.996
Ginger tossed her head.

70
00:04:35.016 --> 00:04:39.198
"If they'd tried any of that with me, I would have given them a good kick."

71
00:04:40.439 --> 00:04:42.980
"I'm sure you would have," Merrylegs said.

72
00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:48.782
"But that's because you've never been in a place that treated you kindly until now.

73
00:04:50.323 --> 00:04:52.144
Anyway, I'm not like you.

74
00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:57.042
That's why the squire trusts me so completely with the little girls.

75
00:04:58.022 --> 00:04:59.763
The other parents trust me too.

76
00:05:01.284 --> 00:05:03.504
They know I would never hurt their children.

77
00:05:04.045 --> 00:05:07.086
Besides, those boys are not bad boys.

78
00:05:08.106 --> 00:05:09.647
They don't mean to be cruel.

79
00:05:10.527 --> 00:05:12.949
They only needed a lesson, that's all."

80
00:05:12.969 --> 00:05:17.530
"I suppose it's your job to teach them," I said thoughtfully.

81
00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:20.772
"Yes, it is," Merrylegs agreed.

82
00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:23.381
"And I want to do a good job.

83
00:05:24.762 --> 00:05:29.946
The people here have treated me kindly for the past five years, and I would never do anything

84
00:05:30.006 --> 00:05:31.127
to make them angry.

85
00:05:32.588 --> 00:05:37.511
If I suddenly started kicking children for acting like children, where would I be?

86
00:05:38.732 --> 00:05:41.294
Sold off in a hurry, that's where!

87
00:05:41.694 --> 00:05:43.455
And none of us want that."

88
00:05:44.476 --> 00:05:46.518
I supposed that Merrylegs was right about that.

89
00:05:47.638 --> 00:05:49.560
None of us wanted to be sold to another owner.

90
00:05:50.753 --> 00:05:55.751
We were all happy at Birtwick Park—even Ginger—and hoped that we could stay there forever.
